  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Karakoro Goudja Resource Management Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to rehabilitate the existing warehouse and multipurpose center; provide processing equipment for balanitesproduction and the collection of gum Arabic; and provide a revolving fund and technical assistance. Additionally; training in financial and organizational managementand literacy will be provided to help the organization improve its capacity and become sustainable.</narrative>
  </description>
